        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woven with blue and white silk and silver thread.  Ground silver and white with a design of bands with scalloped edges, joined by rosettes, so as to make diamonds and irregular forms, in which are bunches of conventional flowers.  These bands are detailed with diaper and flower patterns.  This piece may be old, or it may be a modern reproduction."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/6019822a-896f-340c-b445-8e6861f09d69> ;
